                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "f. In emergency situations, a principal may grant personal leave for a brief period of time pending the later approval by the Superintendent. During the period of time the leave is granted by the principal, the teacher shall not be considered absent without leave.",
            "block_bbox": [
